1
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:25,897
YAMU! YAMU!

2
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,817
YAMU! YAMU!

3
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:28,777
YAMU!

4
00:00:28,860 --> 00:00:29,820
YAMU!

5
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:39,100
It's time to do

6
00:01:06,280 --> 00:01:08,820
This duel is now over, Kaiba!

7
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:12,980
Way to go, Yook!

8
00:01:14,420 --> 00:01:17,000
I told you, hatred never triumphs!

9
00:01:17,660 --> 00:01:20,120
But I had the perfect strategy!

10
00:01:20,640 --> 00:01:26,540
My dark paladin would disagree, Kaiba,
but thanks to his attack, you've lost.

11
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:29,260
No, there must be some mistake!

12
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,177
Kaiba was fighting for
all the wrong reasons,

13
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:36,142
and in the end, it was his own
anger and jealousy that did him in.

14
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:38,740
Battle City is my tournament.

15
00:01:39,240 --> 00:01:42,837
The entire event was designed so
that I would be the ultimate victor.

16
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:46,600
I wanted to put the memory
of my stepfather behind me,

17
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:50,480
and be crowned the world's best
duelist atop my duel tower.

18
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:56,220
But instead, it's Yugi
who now stands victorious.

19
00:01:57,140 --> 00:01:58,640
I was close.

20
00:02:00,080 --> 00:02:04,440
Victory was in my grasp,
but it somehow slipped away.

21
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:12,980
Now it's over. I'm nothing.

22
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:17,740
And the winner is Yugi Moto,

23
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:20,597
who now advances to the final round and

24
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:23,337
faces Marek Ishtar for
the Battle City Crown.

25
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,600
All right!

26
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:26,260
You're the man, Youg!

27
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:28,000
Thank you.

28
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:29,990
Joey!

29
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,860
That's right. I'm back.

30
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:34,340
I see. But how?

31
00:02:34,600 --> 00:02:35,740
It was easy.

32
00:02:36,440 --> 00:02:37,780
Think about it, Youg.

33
00:02:37,900 --> 00:02:41,037
I'd never let a freak show
like Maric get the best of me.

34
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:44,760
And besides, I gave you my word
that I'd help you beat him.

35
00:02:44,860 --> 00:02:46,740
So here I am. Thank you.

36
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:49,470
Awesome!

37
00:02:49,580 --> 00:02:51,109
The gang's together again!

38
00:02:52,140 --> 00:02:54,000
That was some ending, right?

39
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:58,617
You know, the way my red-eyes black dragon
came through and helped Yugi to win?

40
00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:01,406
Yeah, you were snoozing,
but your card wasn't.

41
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:03,095
I guess you're right.

42
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,297
Either way, I was there for my pal.

43
00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:06,210
Joey's right.

44
00:03:06,300 --> 00:03:09,535
If it wasn't for him, I would
never have crushed Kaiba.

45
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:14,580
Blue-eyes ultimate dragon, attack now!

46
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:17,080
Hold on, Yug.

47
00:03:17,620 --> 00:03:18,450
Joey?

48
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,377
Yep, the one and only, pal.

49
00:03:20,460 --> 00:03:22,440
I'm about to lose this duel!

50
00:03:22,660 --> 00:03:23,720
Guess again, Yug.

51
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,297
It's like you always tell me.

52
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:27,920
Look closely and consider
all your options.

53
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,720
All of my options? Yup.

54
00:03:30,040 --> 00:03:32,687
I think you'll find a
card that can save you.

55
00:03:34,940 --> 00:03:38,352
Thanks to Joey's red eyes, I
got the power boost I needed.

56
00:03:38,580 --> 00:03:40,280
We won this duel together!

57
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:47,220
Seto's out of the
tournament now. He's done.

58
00:03:47,460 --> 00:03:48,290
It's all over.

59
00:03:48,373 --> 00:03:50,380
But he came so far.

60
00:03:50,720 --> 00:03:51,880
I don't get it.

61
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:53,940
My deck was unbeatable.

62
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,700
Where did I go wrong?

63
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:58,860
I executed my strategy perfectly,

64
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:02,322
carefully playing each
card exactly as I planned.

65
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:06,111
That was the most challenging
duel I've ever fought, Kaiba.

66
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:08,800
Just save it. It's true.

67
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:13,680
Destiny may have chosen me to be the
victor, Kaiba, but you fought well.

68
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:16,797
I don't need the pep talk, Yugi.

69
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:21,417
It's quite obvious to me that you haven't
learned anything from our duel today,

70
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:23,300
and I'd say that's a shame.

71
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:27,277
You can never truly be
a success until you're

72
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:30,117
able to conquer the
monsters within your heart,

73
00:04:30,200 --> 00:04:31,030
Kaiba.

74
00:04:31,113 --> 00:04:31,943
All right.

75
00:04:32,026 --> 00:04:33,700
I've heard enough out of you.

76
00:04:34,040 --> 00:04:36,740
Deny the truth, and it will destroy you.

77
00:04:38,660 --> 00:04:43,180
You were doomed from the start,
fueled by your anger, your hate,

78
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,520
your jealousy, your rage.

79
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:48,840
And lastly, the denial of your past.

80
00:04:49,180 --> 00:04:51,980
I, on the other hand, was fueled by faith.

81
00:04:52,260 --> 00:04:54,820
Faith in destiny and faith in my friends.

82
00:04:55,160 --> 00:04:56,380
That's how I won.

83
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:58,440
It's true.

84
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:01,597
Even though Joey was
unconscious for most of my duel,

85
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:03,915
it was like he was right here with me.

86
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:07,453
And there's no way I could
have beaten Kaiba without him.

87
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:13,900
After all, it was Joey's Red-Eyes Black
Dragon that made my victory possible.

88
00:05:15,540 --> 00:05:18,020
Kaiba, I didn't crush you on my own.

89
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:22,020
Joey and I did it together
using the card he gave me.

90
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:23,710
Red eyes?

91
00:05:24,660 --> 00:05:26,260
Where did that come from?

92
00:05:26,620 --> 00:05:27,640
If you recall,

93
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:32,037
you used your flute of summoning dragon
to summon your blue eyes to the field.

94
00:05:32,120 --> 00:05:36,296
But you may not have realized that
your flute works on my hand as well.

95
00:05:37,220 --> 00:05:41,140
So I owe you a thank you
for bringing out this card,

96
00:05:41,380 --> 00:05:44,674
which is a gift from a very
close friend of mine, Kaiba.

97
00:05:48,580 --> 00:05:50,940
Red Eyes is no ordinary card.

98
00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:54,749
Its strength comes from the
bond of my friendship with Joey.

99
00:05:54,860 --> 00:05:57,700
That means I never duel alone, Kaiba.

100
00:05:58,280 --> 00:05:59,110
That's right.

101
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,640
You never duel alone? Wake up!

102
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:07,437
Don't you realize that every single
one of us is alone in this world, Yugi?

103
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:08,460
Look at me.

104
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:11,760
I've never had to ask for anyone's help.

105
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:13,680
That's not true.

106
00:06:14,300 --> 00:06:18,340
I've helped Kaiba plenty of times
before, and he's helped me, too.

107
00:06:18,820 --> 00:06:23,960
In fact, I wouldn't be the duelist I am
today if he hadn't pushed me to be my best.

108
00:06:24,200 --> 00:06:28,480
He may be one of my toughest rivals,
but I also consider him a friend.

109
00:06:29,040 --> 00:06:32,080
Deep down, I bet Kaiba
feels the same way about me.

110
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:35,889
He's just too caught up in his
need for power to realize it.

111
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:39,220
You don't consider anyone
your friend, Kaiba?

112
00:06:39,740 --> 00:06:41,152
Friendship is for fools.

113
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:43,440
Didn't I tell you I duel alone?

114
00:06:43,680 --> 00:06:49,337
depending on others is for the weak yugi
my future is in my own two hands so keep

115
00:06:49,420 --> 00:06:51,977
your friendships to
yourself i'm not interested

116
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:55,437
in having any pals to slow me down how

117
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:59,777
sad the time has come to accept my defeat

118
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:02,597
like a man yugi since there's no one else

119
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:05,777
that i rely on there's no one else that i

120
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:11,360
can blame as per the
rules take my rarest card

121
00:07:13,280 --> 00:07:14,580
Ovilisk the Tormentor!

122
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:17,080
Now I have two Egyptian God cards!

123
00:07:20,320 --> 00:07:21,580
Let's go, Mokuba.

124
00:07:22,260 --> 00:07:23,320
Wait up, Seto.

125
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:26,840
Hold on, Kaiba.

126
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:29,040
Why don't you duel me?

127
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:31,597
We'll see who gets the third place crown.

128
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:34,562
Unless, of course, you're
scared of losing to me.

129
00:07:35,380 --> 00:07:36,210
Hey!

130
00:07:37,740 --> 00:07:39,440
I asked you a question.

131
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:41,033
Out of my way, Wheeler.

132
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,937
You think you're too good for
the rest of us, don't you?

133
00:07:44,020 --> 00:07:47,140
Well, I used to be a stubborn
jerk just like you are.

134
00:07:47,660 --> 00:07:50,640
I picked on everyone else
and inside I felt alone.

135
00:07:51,740 --> 00:07:55,780
Then, I was in a tough situation
and Yugi stuck out his neck for me.

136
00:07:59,340 --> 00:08:01,811
He showed me what friendship is all about.

137
00:08:02,620 --> 00:08:06,817
Now I realize that looking out for
other people actually makes us stronger.

138
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:08,665
Yugi changed my life that day.

139
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,860
Thanks, Joey.

140
00:08:10,420 --> 00:08:14,617
And I've seen Yugi stick his neck out
for you a whole bunch of times, Kaiba.

141
00:08:14,700 --> 00:08:16,657
And did you ever once say thank you?

142
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:18,034
Not that I ever heard.

143
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:19,817
Trust me, you need friends.

144
00:08:19,900 --> 00:08:23,841
Take away all your Kaiba Corp
flunkies and who's left on your team?

145
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,668
Please tell me you're done.

146
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:29,701
All this nonsense about friendship
is starting to bore me, Wheeler.

147
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:31,270
That's right.

148
00:08:31,380 --> 00:08:33,877
The last thing my brother
needs is a lecture from you,

149
00:08:33,960 --> 00:08:35,497
so why don't you just lay off?

150
00:08:35,580 --> 00:08:36,410
Oh, really?

151
00:08:36,493 --> 00:08:39,657
How can you defend this guy
after what he said about you?

152
00:08:39,740 --> 00:08:40,570
Me?

153
00:08:40,653 --> 00:08:41,540
What did he say?

154
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:44,080
He said he was happy being all alone.

155
00:08:44,260 --> 00:08:47,672
So I guess what that means is
he doesn't need you, Mokuba.

156
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:50,640
Some big brother.

157
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,260
Look, pal.

158
00:08:52,620 --> 00:08:54,837
You've done nothing
but bust my chops about

159
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:57,457
my duel monster skills
ever since I met you.

160
00:08:57,540 --> 00:09:02,187
Now it seems like you're afraid of losing
to me and looking like a fool, Kaiba.

161
00:09:02,420 --> 00:09:03,250
Watch it.

162
00:09:03,440 --> 00:09:06,097
Push me too far and
you'll regret it, Wheeler.

163
00:09:06,180 --> 00:09:07,357
I'll take my chances.

164
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,460
So, are you gonna duel me or what?

165
00:09:09,820 --> 00:09:13,879
I'm afraid I don't see what the
point is other than to waste my time.

166
00:09:14,140 --> 00:09:15,520
Besides, I'd crush you.

167
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:17,497
Then prove it to me, rich boy.

168
00:09:17,580 --> 00:09:20,117
All right, I've had
enough of your nonsense.

169
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:22,697
I'll accept this ridiculous
challenge of yours.

170
00:09:22,780 --> 00:09:24,368
It shouldn't take too long.

171
00:09:24,540 --> 00:09:28,220
Good, we agree on something.
But Seto... Relax, Mokuba.

172
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:30,969
I'll silence this
amateur once and for all.

173
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:34,551
Now, as soon as you and I begin
this duel of ours, Wheeler,

174
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,917
all the friends on Earth won't save you.

175
00:09:37,000 --> 00:09:37,900
Yeah, dead.

176
00:09:38,040 --> 00:09:39,158
Bring it on, Kaiba.

177
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:44,080
The ultimate battle is fast approaching.

178
00:09:46,860 --> 00:09:49,420
Soon the pharaoh will face my brother,

179
00:09:49,660 --> 00:09:53,040
and the future of mankind
will depend on the outcome.

180
00:09:59,740 --> 00:10:03,900
I'll destroy you even without
my Egyptian god card, Wheeler.

181
00:10:04,220 --> 00:10:05,757
Take your best shot, Kaiba.

182
00:10:05,840 --> 00:10:10,380
Trust me, it won't take my best
to defeat an amateur like you.

183
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:13,720
Then take your worst shot
for all I can, tough guy.

184
00:10:16,220 --> 00:10:18,240
All right, let's do this.

185
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,240
I got a duel to win.

186
00:10:21,520 --> 00:10:25,417
I don't think I've ever seen Joey
look this confident before, guys.

187
00:10:25,500 --> 00:10:26,330
That's true.

188
00:10:26,420 --> 00:10:30,557
Joey has certainly come an extremely
long way to get where he is today.

189
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:31,840
He knows he can win.

190
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:35,460
Go, alligator sword!

191
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:37,369
Teach this fraud a lesson!

192
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:49,620
Now, Battle Warrior and Swordsman
of Lamstar attack his life points!

193
00:10:50,740 --> 00:10:52,040
He's done well.

194
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:56,740
Even Maric quivered in fear when
faced with Joey's skills. So,

195
00:10:57,020 --> 00:10:59,497
now I can sacrifice all
three of my monsters

196
00:10:59,580 --> 00:11:02,051
to bring out my ultimate fighting machine!

197
00:11:05,320 --> 00:11:07,400
Meet Gilbert the Lightning

198
00:11:11,360 --> 00:11:16,180
Now, show him what your special ability
is all about and wipe out his eel

199
00:11:20,220 --> 00:11:23,457
With everything Joey's learned
from this Battle City Tournament

200
00:11:23,540 --> 00:11:27,560
I'd say he has a good chance at
finally defeating Kaiba Yeah,

201
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:31,511
and earning the respect he
deserves from that stuck-up punk

202
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:36,660
Taya, please, take me to my sister.

203
00:11:40,180 --> 00:11:42,500
I'll even let you go first, Kaiba.

204
00:11:43,040 --> 00:11:45,080
Very well, stand back.

205
00:11:46,200 --> 00:11:51,141
Now it's time for me to show this third-rate
wannabe what real dueling is all about.

206
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,580
This'll be over soon.

207
00:11:53,040 --> 00:11:55,800
I'll play Ryukushin Powered.

208
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:04,260
Then I'll place two cards
face down and end my turn.

209
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:08,680
He'll never survive my shrink
and crush card combination.

210
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:12,714
You'll have to do better than
that to beat me, rich boy.

211
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:15,160
Alright, my move.

212
00:12:15,800 --> 00:12:17,260
Not too shabby.

213
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:18,940
Check this out.

214
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:21,400
I play Gierfried, the Iron Knight.

215
00:12:26,060 --> 00:12:27,240
That's right, Kaiba.

216
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:30,317
I know all about you and
your face-down strategies.

217
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:34,097
You were probably all jazzed up
about your two face-down cards.

218
00:12:34,180 --> 00:12:38,240
Well, tough noogies, magic cards
don't work on Gear Freed. Awesome.

219
00:12:38,560 --> 00:12:42,560
This may sound crazy, but I think
Joey's using his head out there.

220
00:12:42,780 --> 00:12:44,117
Well, that's something new.

221
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:47,017
He better not think too hard
or he might hurt himself.

222
00:12:47,100 --> 00:12:47,930
Hey, wait.

223
00:12:48,140 --> 00:12:49,081
Where'd Taya go?

224
00:12:51,180 --> 00:12:53,637
She probably just went to
the bathroom or something.

225
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,550
Relax.

226
00:12:54,633 --> 00:12:57,220
Come on, man, you own
this guy! That's right!

227
00:12:57,800 --> 00:13:00,940
So, Gear Freed, attack
is Ryukushin right now!

228
00:13:04,300 --> 00:13:06,900
Wait, don't be so sure about that.

229
00:13:07,240 --> 00:13:10,040
Reveal my magic card! Shrink!

230
00:13:11,100 --> 00:13:14,917
Watch closely because my magic
card has the power to weaken any

231
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:18,717
monster on the field by cutting
its attack points right in half.

232
00:13:18,800 --> 00:13:23,520
Although, it's not your Iron Knight
I plan to use this card on. Say what?

233
00:13:24,420 --> 00:13:27,080
I'm using it to shrink my own monster.

234
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:29,940
Hold on, he's done this before.

235
00:13:31,380 --> 00:13:33,320
Sorry, Wheeler, you're through.

236
00:13:33,600 --> 00:13:36,857
Because now that my monster has
less than 1,000 attack points,

237
00:13:36,940 --> 00:13:38,700
I can activate this card,

238
00:13:38,960 --> 00:13:40,380
my Crush Card Trap.

239
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:44,300
This infects my own monster
with a devastating virus.

240
00:13:44,780 --> 00:13:48,604
And now that your gear freed
attacked it, that virus will spread.

241
00:13:55,220 --> 00:13:57,920
First it destroys your
monster on the field,

242
00:13:58,100 --> 00:14:01,280
then the virus spreads to
your hand, then your deck,

243
00:14:01,780 --> 00:14:03,980
crushing every strong beast.

244
00:14:09,500 --> 00:14:12,300
Oh, no! Oh, yes. Unfortunately,

245
00:14:12,700 --> 00:14:16,037
every monster with 1,500
attack points or more in Joey's

246
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:20,080
hand and deck will be destroyed
by Kaiba's crush card trap.

247
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,380
Not a good start.

248
00:14:21,660 --> 00:14:22,897
I don't believe this.

249
00:14:22,980 --> 00:14:27,340
Jinzo, Guildford, every one of
my powerful monsters is toast.

250
00:14:27,740 --> 00:14:28,700
Later, guys.

251
00:14:29,880 --> 00:14:31,000
Thanks a lot.

252
00:14:31,500 --> 00:14:34,460
A weak duelist should
have weak monsters, right?

253
00:14:35,080 --> 00:14:38,800
I told you you couldn't handle
an opponent like me. Zip it.

254
00:14:39,040 --> 00:14:41,797
Why don't you just admit
you're in over your head,

255
00:14:41,880 --> 00:14:44,860
Wheeler, and leave now
before you hurt yourself?

256
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,160
Forget it, pal.

257
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:49,977
This duel just started, and I got
strategies you never dreamed of.

258
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:50,890
Hmm.

259
00:14:50,973 --> 00:14:52,897
Don't you know when it's time to quit?

260
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:54,480
My move, now.

261
00:14:55,180 --> 00:14:59,500
Since you have no monsters to
protect you, well, you figure it out.

262
00:14:59,700 --> 00:15:00,900
I summon La Jin.

263
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:04,060
Meet the mystical genie of the lamp.

264
00:15:08,760 --> 00:15:12,300
Oh man, Joey's life points
are wide open to an attack.

265
00:15:12,580 --> 00:15:13,820
This could get ugly.

266
00:15:14,100 --> 00:15:18,280
I'm afraid it's time to say goodbye
to 1,800 of your life points.

267
00:15:18,520 --> 00:15:20,980
Now La Jin, attack him directly.

268
00:15:28,620 --> 00:15:30,920
The time is near, Shizu.

269
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:34,440
Teya, are you all right?

270
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:36,100
You seem a bit lost.

271
00:15:37,940 --> 00:15:40,160
Sister, it's me again.

272
00:15:42,140 --> 00:15:44,860
Merrick, your good side is back.

273
00:15:46,420 --> 00:15:48,360
Had enough yet, Wheeler?

274
00:15:49,340 --> 00:15:50,757
Hang in there!

275
00:15:50,840 --> 00:15:52,060
Great.

276
00:15:52,500 --> 00:15:54,180
Thanks to Kaiba's trap card,

277
00:15:54,400 --> 00:15:57,812
all I've got to work with are
these minor league monsters.

278
00:15:58,980 --> 00:16:01,340
I'll find a way to beat you, Kaiba.

279
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:04,780
This could definitely help.

280
00:16:05,100 --> 00:16:08,860
First, I'll summon Swordsman of Landstar.

281
00:16:11,220 --> 00:16:13,680
Then I'll activate this magic card.

282
00:16:14,700 --> 00:16:15,960
Graceful Dice!

283
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,580
Good thinking, Joey. Joey,

284
00:16:19,880 --> 00:16:22,117
that magic card is an
excellent way to increase

285
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:24,671
the attacking power of your weak monsters.

286
00:16:24,860 --> 00:16:26,980
You can turn this tool around, Joey.

287
00:16:27,560 --> 00:16:28,390
Awesome.

288
00:16:28,473 --> 00:16:30,597
Now Joey's Swordsman of Landstar can gain

289
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:32,937
enough strength to take
down Kaiba's monster.

290
00:16:33,020 --> 00:16:36,917
He just has to roll a high enough
number using his graceful dice card.

291
00:16:37,000 --> 00:16:40,280
Yeah, but Kaiba's genie
has 1,800 attack points.

292
00:16:40,420 --> 00:16:44,538
Which means Joey's got to roll at
least a four if he wants to beat it.

293
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,140
Come on.

294
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,224
Joey needs a new pair of shoes.

295
00:16:52,140 --> 00:16:54,060
You can do this, Chewie!

296
00:16:55,880 --> 00:16:58,320
Come on, four or higher?

297
00:17:04,160 --> 00:17:05,360
Moment of truth.

298
00:17:14,300 --> 00:17:15,130
Yeah!

299
00:17:15,860 --> 00:17:17,160
And that's four!

300
00:17:17,420 --> 00:17:18,837
In your face, Kyber!

301
00:17:18,920 --> 00:17:20,080
Now watch this!

302
00:17:20,420 --> 00:17:24,596
My swordsman's attack points quadrupled,
making it stronger than yours!

303
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,100
Great dueling!

304
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:27,180
Now attack!

305
00:17:27,980 --> 00:17:32,200
Now that's what I call a close one,
but I can't let Kaiba see me sweat.

306
00:17:34,040 --> 00:17:36,360
You can't win a duel with luck, chump.

307
00:17:36,620 --> 00:17:41,400
Maybe, but it certainly gave my swordsman
enough power to cut your genie down.

308
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:55,700
Hey, Dad, now you're another 200 life
points closer to losing this duel, pal.

309
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:59,680
So you won that battle,
but you won't win the war.

310
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:04,060
Merrick, it's been so long
since you last appeared to me.

311
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:06,580
Sister, it's me.

312
00:18:07,380 --> 00:18:08,400
Your brother.

313
00:18:09,040 --> 00:18:10,120
You're Merrick?

314
00:18:10,560 --> 00:18:13,100
You must save Odeon right now.

315
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:16,557
I knew that your good half took
shelter within Taya's mind,

316
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:20,320
But I also knew you were weak,
and couldn't hold on for long.

317
00:18:21,320 --> 00:18:22,150
That's true.

318
00:18:22,440 --> 00:18:25,980
As my dark side grows strong, I grow weak.

319
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:31,300
But I've been in Taya's mind long enough
to have learned the truth about our past.

320
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:35,600
Through her ears, I listen to
you tell the story of our family,

321
00:18:35,820 --> 00:18:38,360
and the emergence of the evil within me.

322
00:18:39,860 --> 00:18:42,080
I order you to put that down!

323
00:18:42,520 --> 00:18:45,300
And if I don't, Merrick, drop it!

324
00:18:50,340 --> 00:18:54,600
I never knew that I was the one who
sent Father to the Shadow Realm.

325
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:56,220
Yes, but... I know.

326
00:18:56,480 --> 00:18:59,715
It was the evil force within
me that committed the act.

327
00:19:00,120 --> 00:19:02,980
So you came here to save me from myself.

328
00:19:03,320 --> 00:19:07,379
Despite everything I've done in my
quest for power, you've had faith.

329
00:19:07,500 --> 00:19:09,900
You knew there was still good within me.

330
00:19:10,320 --> 00:19:14,440
However, that good is almost
completely extinguished now.

331
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:15,790
Oh, no.

332
00:19:15,873 --> 00:19:19,540
If the evil force defeats the
pharaoh in the final battle,

333
00:19:19,840 --> 00:19:24,860
you will be gone forever, and the
entire planet will suffer greatly.

334
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:29,300
Well, I can't allow one duel to
decide the fate of the whole world.

335
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:33,300
The time has come for me to step
in and reclaim my body, sister.

336
00:19:33,840 --> 00:19:34,800
But how?

337
00:19:35,360 --> 00:19:39,440
I don't know, but I must banish
that evil before it's too late.

338
00:19:39,760 --> 00:19:41,525
There's just too much at risk.

339
00:19:42,240 --> 00:19:44,060
No, it's far too dangerous.

340
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:45,580
Wait, Merrick.

341
00:19:45,980 --> 00:19:48,120
Sister, take care of Odeon.

342
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:50,120
Merrick, don't go, please.

343
00:19:52,100 --> 00:19:54,060
Merrick, come back.
